      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Pioneer Village, Nebraska’s premier living‑history museum, showcases 28 buildings from a sod house to a Pony Express station, arranged chronologically to tell the pioneer story.",
